{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\"issues\":[{\"sec\":\"S02\",\"screen\":\"像熟人安静坐着 偶尔对视也不尴尬\",\"source\":\"也像相识已久的人安静坐着，不必拼命找话题；对方偶尔望来一眼，沉默也不让人紧张。\",\"type\":\"5\",\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"把对方单方面偶尔望来一眼改成双方对视，增加了原文没有明确写出的相互注视。\"},{\"sec\":\"S05\",\"screen\":\"只剩一条单薄旋律，在雾里的水域漫无目的地游走\",\"source\":\"一条单薄、孤零零的旋律，在空中漫无目的地游走。像小船漂进一片起雾的水域，前路未卜。\",\"type\":\"5\",\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"原文分别写旋律在空中游走和小船漂进雾中，屏幕稿将两幅画面合成旋律在雾中水域游走，改变了原来的画面。\"}]}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "5afc4173-3765-4a02-a4fe-9de159b4b01d", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T192602802949Z", "elapsed_seconds": 372.187, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T19:32:15.000162+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "f55900677b398795c4526cd9cfd519ecf98a68896e22811961cfb638ac5ccfa8", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.p